sequenceDiagram
  participant Ag as Builder agent
  participant PEP as Enforcement point
  participant IdP as Identity provider
  participant Repo as Repository
  Ag->>PEP: write Candidate/Program.cs
  PEP->>IdP: current mandate and scope?
  IdP-->>PEP: MND-2026-114 valid, write Candidate/**
  PEP->>Repo: write allowed
  Ag->>PEP: write contracts/cases.json
  PEP-->>Ag: denied, outside the mandate
  Note over PEP: the rule is enforced where the action happens
